{"metas":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvRm9yZXZlciUyMCUyODIwMTQlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Forever","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4OnnU4j2tQEOnsPnRZswW91v9vr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ziXtCZye3NowgFJCBrK3kTd7vn.jpg","description":"Doctor Henry Morgan, New York City’s star medical examiner, has a secret. He doesn't just study the dead to solve criminal cases, he does it to solve the mystery that has eluded him for 200 years—the answer to his own inexplicable immortality. This long life has given Henry remarkable observation skills which impresses his new partner, Detective Jo Martinez. Each week, a new case and their budding friendship will reveal layers of Henry’s long and colorful past. Only his best friend and confidant, Abe knows Henry’s secret.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvRnJvbSUyMER1c2slMjBUaWxsJTIwRGF3biUyMFRoZSUyMFNlcmllcyUyMCUyMCUyODIwMTQlMjkv","type":"series","name":"From Dusk Till Dawn The Series","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/pAfTOb7lHvRlTa86jw99nM8iU3K.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fFi7yMB4ylHYRfn4o8idbhgnoRK.jpg","description":"The horror and crime thriller genres collide in this new original series from Robert Rodriguez, based on his cult grindhouse classic about bank-robbing brothers on the run, a lawman bent on bringing them to justice, the devout family caught in the cross-fire, and an ancient evil eager to feast on them all.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTGFzdC1XZWVrLVRvbmlnaHQtd2l0aC1Kb2huLU9saXZlci0yMDE0Lw","type":"series","name":"Last Week Tonight with John Oliver","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fuuEjEr69uvRtGaQw70JfvdrUwb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q31EEBycbOyX7GGJP4GTPI5WJRO.jpg","de