fo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUGVubnktRHJlYWRmdWwtMjAxNC8","type":"series","name":"Penny Dreadful","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hQSdrXBYTbLGHYDIseHkBOPXTgL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/32iacqVElB91YZKl9Ky3QEEkXtH.jpg","description":"Some of literature's most terrifying characters, including Dr. Frankenstein, Dorian Gray, and iconic figures from the novel Dracula are lurking in the darkest corners of Victorian London. Penny Dreadful is a frightening psychological thriller that weaves together these classic horror origin stories into a new adult drama.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUG93ZXItJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTQtJTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Power 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmFpc2luZy1Ib3BlLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDEwLTIwMTQlMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Raising Hope 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmF2ZW5zd29vZC0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMy0yMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Ravenswood","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmVtZW1iZXItTWUtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNCUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Remember Me (TV Mini Series 2014)","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2aWV3LSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE0LSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Review","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/igseZf0ClaW0kzqnAIORuXjNxkR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dr8oooQY5BJuHihzk6JihNiOrdW.jpg","description":"A review of a movie, or a restaurant, or a car—or whatever else that typically falls under a critic's domain—is all well and good, and can even be helpful at times. But how can one find out about myriad other experiences that are never tackled in reviews? Enter Forrest MacNeil, a critic who goes beyond overviews of life's more-common subjects—way beyond—to satisfy the curiosity of others: The adrenaline rush of stealing; the danger of drug addiction; the delight of sleeping with a celebrity. MacNeil tries anything suggested by viewers of his TV show, then presents a 1-to-5-star review. But his unwavering commitment to experiencing intense adventures means he must deal with the unintended consequences of such a goal.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUnVzaC0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNCUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"Rush 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU2FtLUNhdC0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMy0yMDE0JTI5LTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Sam Cat 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU2NvcnBpb24tJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTQtJTI5LTEwODBwLw","type":"series","name":"Scorpion 1080p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvU2lsaWNvbi1WYWxsZXktJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTQtJTI5LTEwODBwLw","type":"series","name":"Silicon Valley 1080p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGF4aS1Ccm9va2x5bi0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNCUyOS8"