r Sara Hadley and Attorney Jack McAllister leads to an instant and undeniable attraction. Just as Sara and Jack's affair is starting, the lovers find themselves in an impossible situation—on opposite sides of a murder investigation.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvQnJlYWtpbmclMjBCYWQlMjAlMjgyMDA4LTIwMTMlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Breaking Bad","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvRGElMjBWaW5jaXMlMjBEZW1vbnMlMjAlMjgyMDEzJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Da Vincis Demons","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/sR8m3EUxmRJi4S9u5sfBDRLce1Z.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wHcLMdK85CIJu76RNxnq6rhS2FF.jpg","description":"The series follows the \"untold\" story of Leonardo Da Vinci: the genius during his early years in Renaissance Florence. As a 25-year old artist, inventor, swordsman, lover, dreamer and idealist, he struggles to live within the confines of his own reality and time as he begins to not only see the future, but invent it.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvSG91c2UlMjBvZiUyMENhcmRzJTIwJTI4MjAxMyUyOS8","type":"series","name":"House of Cards","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hKWxWjFwnMvkWQawbhvC0Y7ygQ8.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zoAxfThy7ntyCutBeNgdaKhRoSX.jpg","description":"Betrayed by the White House, Congressman Frank Underwood embarks on a ruthless rise to power. Blackmail, seduction and ambition are his weapons.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTGFzdC1SZXNvcnQtMjAxMi0yMDEzLw","type":"series","name":"Last Resort 2012","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["English"]},