ory of Ike Evans, the owner of Miami's most glamorous hotel, the Miramar Playa. Evans is forced to make an ill-fated deal with Miami mob boss Ben Diamond to ensure the success of his glitzy establishment.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWFqb3ItQ3JpbWVzLTIwMTIv","type":"series","name":"Major Crimes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fZ502JXujnxVtprmigTO2jA205P.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8AkvTlCLmGipNEGL9wYVfWMiPLd.jpg","description":"Major Crimes explores how the American justice system approaches the art of the deals as law enforcement officers and prosecutors work together to score a conviction. Los Angeles Police Captain Sharon Raydor heads up a special squad within the LAPD that deals with high-profile or particularly sensitive crimes.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTWlsbGlvbi1Eb2xsYXItTGlzdGluZy1OZXctWW9yay0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMiUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Million Dollar Listing New York","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/en2WjVfxZuPEWH1XP6Y7uXCydEC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ofF5RAkRqvPuyKFfvzrg9wM9sV.jpg","description":"Follows some of Manhattan's most relentless realtors as they close multimillion dollar deals faster than a yellow cab runs a red light.","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvTmFzaHZpbGxlLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDEyLSUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"Nashville 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvUmV2b2x1dGlvbi0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAxMi0lMjktNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"Revolution 720p","description":"Folder: English","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["English"]},{"i